{TEXT("炮组依标定地段持续射击，细小的散布沿阵地展开。\n快速响应；最多六发直射炮弹。可损伤车体与履带，也能杀伤步兵。土坡与工事会截住炮弹。"),TEXT("The gun crew fires along the ordered sector, placing a narrow spread across the position.\nFast response; up to six direct-fire shells. Damages hulls and tracks and can strike infantry. Banks and fortifications intercept the rounds.")},
